  "question": {
    "text": "If the equations <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> have a common root different from <math><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>3</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let common root be <math><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ...<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ...<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>, we get <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Put <math><mi>x</mi></math> in Equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>, we get<br /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;+&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> <math><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> <math><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo>&#160; </math> <math><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo>&#160;&#160;</math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><br />When &nbsp;<math><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;then common root <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi> </mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />But the given common root <math><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;&#160;</mo></math><math><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>i</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>"
  }
